sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant EPP as EPP<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelPods as Model Server Pods<br/>HTTP
    participant Selected as Selected Model Server

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Selected: Flow 1: Inference Request Routing (Gateway Mode)
        Client->>Envoy: HTTPS/443<br/>Bearer Token
        Envoy->>EPP: gRPC ext-proc callout<br/>9002/TCP (Optional TLS)
        EPP->>K8s: Watch InferencePool, Pods<br/>6443/TCP TLS (ServiceAccount)
        EPP->>ModelPods: Scrape metrics<br/>HTTP (queue depth, KV-cache, LoRA)
        EPP-->>Envoy: Routing decision<br/>(selected endpoint)
        Envoy->>Selected: Forward request<br/>HTTP
        Selected-->>Envoy: Inference response
        Envoy-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end

    participant Coordinator as Coordinator<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS
    participant Render as Rendering Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant InfGW as Inference Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,InfGW: Flow 2: Disaggregated Inference (E/P/D via Coordinator)
        Client->>Coordinator: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        Coordinator->>Render: Tokenize request<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
        Render-->>Coordinator: Tokenized payload
        Coordinator->>InfGW: Encode request<br/>80/TCP HTTP
        InfGW-->>Coordinator: Encode result
        Coordinator->>InfGW: Prefill request<br/>80/TCP HTTP
        InfGW-->>Coordinator: Prefill result
        Coordinator->>InfGW: Decode request<br/>80/TCP HTTP (SSE streaming)
        InfGW-->>Coordinator: Streamed response
        Coordinator-->>Client: SSE stream response
    end

    participant Sidecar as Sidecar Proxy<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Prefill Worker<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Decode as Local Decoder<br/>8200/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Envoy,Decode: Flow 3: Sidecar Disaggregated Prefill
        Envoy->>Sidecar: Inference request<br/>8000/TCP HTTP (Optional TLS)
        Sidecar->>Prefill: Prefill request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (Optional TLS)
        Prefill-->>Sidecar: Prefill + KV-cache transfer
        Sidecar->>Decode: Decode request<br/>8200/TCP HTTP
        Decode-->>Sidecar: Inference result
        Sidecar-->>Envoy: Response
    end
